#, kde-format
msgid "A duplicate ID was found in the book %1. This can happen if you manipulate the data files by hand, and will prevent KJots from working correctly. KJots can attempt to fix this, or you can fix it yourself. In either case, bookmarks and links between pages may be broken."
msgstr "Binnen dat Book »%1« gifft dat IDs dubbelt. Dat kann vörkamen, wenn Du de Datendateien vun Hand ännerst - KJots löppt denn nich propper. KJots kann dat versöken un richt dat, man Du kannst dat ok sülvst doon. Liekerveel, de Leestekens un Links sünd nu villicht schaadhaftig."

#. +> trunk stable
#: kjotsentry.cpp:104
msgid "A duplicate ID was found"
msgstr "Dubbelt ID funnen"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kjotsentry.cpp:104
msgid "Exit and fix by hand"
msgstr "Utmaken un vun Hand richten"

#. +> trunk stable
#: kjotsentry.cpp:105
msgid "Fix it automatically"
msgstr "Automaatsch richten"

